    withdrawTitle: 'How to withdraw or change consent',
    withdrawBody: 'Open “Cookie Settings” in the website footer at any time to accept all, keep essential only, or toggle Analytics. You can also clear site data in your browser settings. Withdrawing analytics consent stops further Analytics collection; essential/functional storage remains required for the service.',
